; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Application.c	  1501  \ID SBSW_OS_APP_APPTERMINATEAPPLICATION_001
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Application.c	  1502   \DESCRIPTION    Os_AppTerminateApplication is called with the return values of Os_AppId2App() and
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Application.c	  1503                   Os_ThreadGetCurrentApplication().
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Application.c	  1504   \COUNTERMEASURE \M [CM_OS_APPID2APP_M]. No check required for Os_ThreadGetCurrentApplication
